{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tenji was transported to another world, it's a different world compared to his place where he usually lives. Things are rather very complicated in this world there are conflicts, demon invasion etc, would someone like tenji be able to adapt to this new environment. Back in his world tenji has already master the adaptability one of the most important part of human knowledge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787640/extras/6f2f062b0b6f58ceb37e95082a14c362.avif?t=1754941222\" width=357 height=540 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787640/extras/e77e328b56c24485b5171afd614254c3.webp?t=1754941222\" width=422 height=47 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the start you have already two characters besides you, level them up and search for good equipments and gold at the starter map that filled with monsters to hunt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill monsters to earn gold, enjoy exploring the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapons &amp; Armors</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many different types of equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787640/extras/2944868c184786542ad591dbaee35c54.poster.avif?t=1754941222\" width=474 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787640/extras/2944868c184786542ad591dbaee35c54.webm?t=1754941222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787640/extras/2944868c184786542ad591dbaee35c54.mp4?t=1754941222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss Battles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are rare equipment drops from boss battles. And unlock the new map by defeating them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gacha</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get their ultimate skill by playing the gacha system in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock all the chapters by completing quests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3787640?t=1754941222","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787640/5372eaa19f03a0a5136d2bb1d5157d2bcca67e46/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754941222","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787640/6f850fbe960be33e8f1c55366405171ff5e70733/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754941222","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787640/6f850fbe960be33e8f1c55366405171ff5e70733/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754941222","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tenji was transported to another world, it's a different world compared to his place where he usually lives. Things are rather very complicated in this world there are conflicts, demon invasion etc, would someone like tenji be able to adapt to this new environment. Back in his world tenji has already master the adaptability one of the most important part of human knowledge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >